{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36707","headline":"三衢哭孙员外 · 罗隐","name":"三衢哭孙员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕恋雕梁马恋轩，此心从此更何言。\n直将尘外三生命，未敌君侯一日恩。\n红蜡有时还入梦，片帆何处独销魂？\n忍看明发衣襟上，珠泪痕中见酒痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36707.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36707","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}